SF0098 School board trustees-party affiliation.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Olsen, Biteman and Salazar and
Representative(s) Andrew, Haroldson, Heiner and
Neiman
AN ACT relating to ballots; requiring candidates for school board trustee to
have their political party affiliation printed on general election ballots;
requiring rulemaking; and providing for an effective date.
